OL,3,ABaby girl dies while camping with
OL,4,Afamily in woods
OL,5,
OL,6,F"While the investigation remains at an
OL,7,Fearly stage, this is an isolated
OL,8,Fincident," Det Insp Katie Gregory said.
OL,9,F"The death is being treated as
OL,10,Funexplained at this time."
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
