OL,3,ATV presenter among 12 sentenced to
OL,4,Adeath in Egypt drugs case
OL,5,
OL,6,FEgyptian television presenter Sarah
OL,7,FKhalifa and 11 other people have been
OL,8,Fsentenced to death by hanging after
OL,9,Fbeing convicted of drugs charges.
OL,11,FAccording to state-owned al-Ahram
OL,12,Fnewspaper, they were part of a criminal
OL,13,Fgang which imported ingredients used to
OL,14,Fmake drugs with the intent of selling
OL,15,Fthem.
OL,17,FThey also had illegal firearms and
OL,18,Fmunitions.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
